Row 1 (left to right):
1. A ball of fire flying in on a diagonal with a thick flame tail.
2. One big angular ice shard driving in on a diagonal, chunky splinters where it hits.
3. Thick jagged ice spikes bursting outward in every direction from one center point, like a star.

Row 2 (left to right):
4. One heavy zigzag lightning bolt striking down on a diagonal.
5. One heavy zigzag lightning bolt jumping in three hops across the icon from left to right, each hop smaller than the last.
6. A round orb with tall thick flames rising off its top.

Row 3 (left to right):
7. A round orb locked inside a block of jagged ice, three heavy icicles hanging below.
8. A round orb with two thick zigzag bolts bursting out from its sides.
9. One round orb front-on with two thick hollow ring copies of it trailing behind on a diagonal, each copy smaller.
